  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花、そろそろ出番だぞ。準備の方はどうだ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040150010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00008",
    "bgm": "006",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110010,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\n……うん、大丈夫……だよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もしかして、緊張してるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ちょ、ちょっとだけ……\r\n……にへへ、プロデューサーさんには、バレバレだね……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まあ、大きいステージだから無理もないな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……緊張、してる……けど……\r\n甜花、頑張る……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甜花……ずいぶん前向きになったな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "…………\r\nあ、あのね……プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "off",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　なんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "て、甜花、アイドルってね……甜花には全然関係ない、\r\nすごく、遠い世界の人だって思ってた……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花の世界は……なーちゃんと、甜花だけで……\r\nなーちゃんに……いっぱい、迷惑かけてて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "もっと、甜花だけでも……ちゃんと、できるように……\r\nそんな風に変わりたい……けど、無理だって、思ってた……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも、アイドルになって千雪さんや、みんなに出会えて……\r\n信じられないようなこと、いっぱいあって……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花の世界、すごく広がったんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。それは今も、これからも、\r\nどんどん広がっていくんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そ、そのお陰で、ね……\r\n最初は自分のことで、精一杯だったけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "最近は……もっと、みんなを楽しませたいって……\r\nそう、思うようになった……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花が、みんなに笑顔を……分けられることが……\r\n嬉しくなってきたんだ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、甜花が成長した証だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……でも、甜花だけじゃ、\r\nこんな風になれなかった……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "こんな甜花になれたのは……プロデューサーさんのお陰\r\nありがと、プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう言ってもらえて、嬉しいよ\r\nこれからも、もっと多くの人に笑顔を届けていこうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……甜花、頑張るね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……おっと、そろそろスタンバイだな\r\n甜花、いけそうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だ、大丈夫……\r\n……プロデューサーさん……あとひとつだけ、良い？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、どうしたんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさんは、甜花に自信をくれて……\r\nアイドルとして、ここまで……連れてきてくれた……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だから、甜花……\r\nそのお返し……したい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お返し？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花、プロデューサーさんが……\r\n楽しんでくれるライブを、したい……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんにも、喜んでほしい……！\r\nプロデューサーさんに、笑顔になってほしい……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だから、甜花のこと……見ててね……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ！　ちゃんと見てるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "約束だよ……プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500411/2015004110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004110240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "じゃ、じゃあ……行ってきます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
